  "m_dialogList": {
    "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
    "m_dialogs": [
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Prep",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-PRIM-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Magic? Ah. Humor. In some cultures we sailed past, it is considered a mental illness. So you're as well as you ever were.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Turtle_Captain_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Captain_Powe_AH-PRIM_028.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1765224,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-PRIM-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Can't say the same for the ship. Well, I could. It is physically intact; ah, but her spirit is broken.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Turtle_Captain_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Captain_Powe_AH-PRIM_029.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1765224,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-PRIM-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Also its mast is burned; it won't be moving anytime soon.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Turtle_Captain_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Captain_Powe_AH-PRIM_030.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1765224,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-PRIM-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "The Shellions, their \"soulik\" and some of your crew aren't accounted for either. My crew is plumbing the depths; but to date, only I have succeeded.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Turtle_Captain_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Captain_Powe_AH-PRIM_031.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1765224,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-PRIM-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I can return you to the hulk of the ship anytime. But all tides flow to these islands. Odds are your missing friends followed in your wake.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Turtle_Captain_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Captain_Powe_AH-PRIM_032.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1765224,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-PRIM-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Venture out then and explore this place, see what - or who - you can find.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Turtle_Captain_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Captain_Powe_AH-PRIM_033.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1765224,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
